# CVE entries are private by default. Only entries listed below with "!" are pushed.
# To publish one: confirm the vendor advisory is public and your name is on it,
# resolve its TODOs, then add a "!_cves/<CVE-ID>.md" line here.
_cves/*
!_cves/CVE-2026-70338.md
# Turkish translations follow the same rule: _cves/tr/<CVE-ID>.md, allowlisted one by one.
!_cves/tr/
_cves/tr/*
!_cves/tr/CVE-2026-70338.md

